{
  "id": "universal-l-cancel",
  "name": "L-cancel",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "Halve an aerial's landing lag",
  "why": "Landing during an aerial puts {char} into that aerial's landing lag, frames in which {char} cannot act. An L-cancel halves it, so after an aerial on shield the opponent has less time to punish, and after a hit {char} can follow up sooner.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "An L-cancel is a press of L, R or Z just before landing during an aerial. It halves the aerial's landing lag.",
    "expect": "Each jump is judged when the landing lag ends: whether {char} landed during the aerial, and how many frames before the landing L, R or Z was pressed. After misses, the coach shows your press and the landing frame by frame.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": "SA"
      },
      {
        "press": "R",
        "frame": "NL-2"
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed and released: short hop",
      "SA": "Frame {SA}: the aerial",
      "NL-2": "Frame {NL-2}: R pressed, 2 frames before the landing",
      "NL": "Frame {NL}: landed during the aerial. Landing lag, halved"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Landing lag",
        "text": [
          "When {char} lands while an aerial is still going, {char} enters that aerial's landing lag: a fixed number of frames in which {char} cannot act. Each aerial of each character has its own landing lag.",
          "An aerial that has already ended, or that lands in its first or last few frames, has no landing lag: {char} lands with the normal landing lag of {LAND} frames. This is an auto-cancel, and there is nothing to L-cancel."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "SA"
              }
            ],
            "inputs_for": {
              "mr-game-and-watch": [
                {
                  "press": "jump",
                  "frame": 1,
                  "hold": 1
                },
                {
                  "cstick": [
                    0,
                    -1
                  ],
                  "frame": "SA"
                }
              ]
            },
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed and released: short hop",
              "SA": "Frame {SA}: the aerial",
              "NL": "Frame {NL}: landed during the aerial: landing lag"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  "SA",
                  "NL-1"
                ],
                "words": "Aerial",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "NL",
                  "NL+11"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag: {char} cannot act",
                "kind": "late"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "How to L-cancel",
        "text": [
          "The game counts the frames since L, R or Z was last pressed. If {char} lands during an aerial on the frame of the press or within the 6 frames after it, the aerial's landing lag is halved, rounded down. A light press of L or R counts.",
          "A press 7 or more frames before the landing does nothing, and so does a press after the landing. The 7 frames that count end on the landing frame."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "SA"
              },
              {
                "press": "R",
                "frame": "NL-2"
              }
            ],
            "inputs_for": {
              "mr-game-and-watch": [
                {
                  "press": "jump",
                  "frame": 1,
                  "hold": 1
                },
                {
                  "cstick": [
                    0,
                    -1
                  ],
                  "frame": "SA"
                },
                {
                  "press": "R",
                  "frame": "NL-3"
                }
              ]
            },
            "marks": {
              "SA": "Frame {SA}: the aerial",
              "NL-2": "Frame {NL-2}: R pressed, 2 frames before the landing",
              "NL": "Frame {NL}: landed during the aerial. Landing lag, halved"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  "NL-9",
                  "NL-7"
                ],
                "words": "Pressed here: too early",
                "kind": "late"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "NL-6",
                  "NL"
                ],
                "words": "Press now: L-cancel",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "NL+1",
                  "NL+5"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag, halved",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "example_for": {
      "mr-game-and-watch": [
        {
          "press": "jump",
          "frame": 1,
          "hold": 1
        },
        {
          "cstick": [
            0,
            -1
          ],
          "frame": "SA"
        },
        {
          "press": "R",
          "frame": "NL-3"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "On the stage",
      "stage": "final-destination",
      "player": {
        "x": -20
